{"text": "Della put up her hair again, nervously and quickly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For a moment she stood still while a tear or two splashed on the worn red carpet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then she put on her old brown jacket and her old brown hat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With the brilliant sparkle still in her eyes, she hurried out the door and down the stairs to the street. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She stopped at a shop with a sign that said, Madame Sofronie, Hair Goods of All Kinds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Della ran up one flight of stairs and caught her breath. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Will you buy my hair, asked Della. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I buy hair, said Madame. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Take your hat off and lets have a look at it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Down rippled the brown waterfall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twenty dollars, said Madame, lifting the mass with a practiced hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Give it to me quick, said Della.", "alignment": {"characters": ["D", "e", "l", "l", "a", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "u", "p", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "a", "i", "r", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", ",", " ", "n", "e", "r", "v", "o", "u", "s", "l", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "q", "u", "i", "c", "k", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "m", "o", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "o", "o", "d", " ", "s", "t", "i", "l", "l", " ", "w", "h", "i", "l", "e", " ", "a", " ", "t", "e", "a", "r", " ", "o", "r", " ", "t", "w", "o", " ", "s", "p", "l", "a", "s", "h", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "r", "n", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "c", "a", "r", "p", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "p", "u", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "o", "l", "d", 